Description: Rebrand as microDLNA 1.0.0
 Rename the project so this fork can't be confused with MiniDLNA:
 minidlna.c, minidlna.conf(.5), minidlnad.8, minidlnapath.h,
 minidlnatypes.h, po/minidlna.pot, the init script template and the
 buildroot package become microdlna*, the daemon is microdlnad, paths and
 the gettext domain use microdlna, MINIDLNA_* macros become MICRODLNA_*,
 and the UPnP server name and default friendly name say microDLNA.
 Copyright notices are kept, and upstream URLs still point at MiniDLNA.
 Version 1.0.0.
Author: xuancong <xuancong.wang@moht.com.sg>
Last-Update: 2026-10-23
